'''Ambu's Charge''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Crusader Chainmail}}.

==Mechanics==
* {{c|mod|	Your nearby party members maximum Endurance Charges is equal to yours}} overrides the maximum [[Endurance Charge]] stat for all nearby [[party]] members.
** This modifier appears to currently be bugged if multiple players are wearing Ambu's Charge. Which player's maximum endurance charges taking priority appears to be inconsistent, and it is even sometimes possible for a player to overwrite their own maximum charges through snapshotting/recursion, ignoring any modifications to their charges such as {{il|Fragility}}.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3533137</ref>
** This modifier will NOT override {{c|mod|Maximum Endurance, Frenzy and Power Charges is 0}} from {{il|Eternal Damnation}}.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6kZ-Srr8tY</ref>

